  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ライブの仕事が決まってから、前より練習に熱が入ってる\r\nそれはいいことだと思うけど……）",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様。調子はどうだ？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001040020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あっ、プロデューサー。お疲れ～\r\n調子はそうだねー、まあいい感じなんじゃないかな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700104/1007001040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（最近の結華は、少し気になるんだよな……）",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……疲れてないか？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001040030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "なになに突然。Ｐたんにはそう見えたの？\r\nでも残念でした～、いつも通り絶好調だよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700104/1007001040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ何か、悩みとかは……",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001040040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あったら相談してるって！\r\n三峰、報連相はちゃんとする子ですよ～？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700104/1007001040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001040050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……もしかして、Ｐたん甘えられたい時期だったり？\r\n惜しいなぁ、三峰今そういうんじゃないんだよねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700104/1007001040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……これ以上話しても、\r\n何も教えてくれない、か……）",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……わかった。なら、くれぐれも無理はするなよ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001040060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おっけーおっけー、任せてちょうだいな\r\n三峰から１番遠い言葉でしょ。『無理』なんてさ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700104/1007001040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺は仕事があるから出るけど。ほどほどにな",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001040070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いってらっしゃ～い",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700104/1007001040070"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
